WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.610
Princess...

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.820
Yakumo? What's wrong?

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.500
You may return to your owner's side.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.020
Excel...

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.280
Akane...

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.830
Damn you... Reishin...

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.590
Excel...

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.050
Will Shishigami Reishin be the one to gain the power of the Masagami?

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.220
However...

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:28.350
"Awakening"

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:29.060
What are you plotting?

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.690
I highly doubt that you only wish to gain the power of the Masagami.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.530
That Tera... Who are you?

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.700
I am one who scribes all that happens in this world.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.410
Then sit and watch silently.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:48.210
It would be troublesome if the world of which I write disappeared.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.460
Do what needs to be done.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:54.800
All right.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.630
Then I shall record this.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.840
Even if everything were to vanish, I would do so until the very end.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.860
That radiance...

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.030
So that is the Reiouseki.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:38.170
Reishin, as long as it's you... You will definitely succeed.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.520
Let's go.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.600
Yes.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.610
Synchro.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:07.740
This is the densest Tera... The deepest synchro I've ever seen.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.960
This is the strongest pairing of a Mototsumitama and human contractee I've ever seen.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:18.300
What do these two plan to do once they gain the power of the Masagami?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.970
More... More Tera!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.660
What?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.970
Riona-san!

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.330
The sky is...

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.750
What... is this?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.750
It sounds like it's filled with hatred and malice.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.010
W-What is this?

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.880
Riona-san, let's hurry.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.840
Y-Yeah.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.780
Is that...

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.290
Is that the power of the Masagami?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.010
These are physical manifestations of malice.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.800
What a terrifying amount.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.940
The time has come.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:42.150
We will once again become one.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.320
We shall reign over the world.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:51.070
Kuro!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.250
Excel-san!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.880
Are you all right?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.760
Don't mind us. Those two need more attention.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.680
Keita!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.760
Princess.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.010
A-Are they dead?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:16.600
No, their flow of Tera has momentarily been halted.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.520
Was this... Reishin-sama's doing?

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.120
Riona-san!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:38.960
Please remain calm.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.000
Yakumo...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.840
It is fine.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.300
I will protect you.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:53.390
I believe in you, Yakumo, so I'll fight, too.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.440
Synchro!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.950
Yakumo!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.960
Namu!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.210
They are after the Shishigami princess.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.170
Do not let them near her.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.340
Understood!

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:34.930
Cover me.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.230
I won't let you lay a finger on the princess!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.250
Kuro?

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.920
Hey, Kuro!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.010
As I thought... She will not awaken.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.430
No...

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.260
Hm?

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.850
There's something wrong... with Kuro's Tera.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.770
What is Yakumo fighting?

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.570
Reishin destroyed the Reiouseki.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.780
Then they've obtained the power of the Masagami?

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.530
One may assume that.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.490
Yet one may also assume the opposite.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:39.870
What do you mean?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:47.920
The hatred... The rancor... They have stained the sky dark. That malice is now enveloping everything in the world.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:52.010
That which was sealed away inside the Reiouseki...

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.930
Was most probably...

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.480
What a fierce enmity.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:14.570
Is that how much you hated being sealed away, Masagami?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.570
Hurry and come out.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.330
I've come this far

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.160
to fight you.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:33.300
That which was sealed was probably the Masagami itself.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.930
Reishin was well aware of that fact.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:48.440
Everything... started at that moment.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.700
Could that be...

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.870
That emblem is...

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.380
Maiden of the shrine, please start the dream rites.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.610
Shrine maiden of the Shishigami...

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.860
Mother, what kind of dream did you have?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.530
No, it was nothing ominous.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.330
Mother, what is it?

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.630
Listen to me with a calm heart, Reishin.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.550
Tonight, Kuro will be killed.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:04.640
It has always been that any who bear that emblem will be killed.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:09.640
But you said  the dream you saw was nothing ominous...

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:18.150
I saw a dream where there was one who would challenge the Masagami in the human world.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:23.160
And this is the Thousands, passed down through the Shishigami lineage.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:28.370
In ancient battles, this was used by humans who formed contracts with the Mototsumitama of the Shishigami clan

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.160
and fought against the Masagami.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:41.420
If she were to become a Master Root, as a human, she would possess the ultimate Tera.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:49.180
Her birth and the appearance of the emblem on her are both links in the chain of events.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:54.350
However, the elders are striving to avoid battle with the Masagami.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.690
That's why they want to kill Kuro.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.700
I can no longer suppress the wishes of the elders.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:05.950
Now is the time to relieve our clan from the curse.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:11.290
Reishin, you are to cleave apart this evil string of fate with your own hands.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.960
Fellow members of the clan, listen well.

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:22.340
It is now as clear as day that the princess is the reincarnation of the Masagami.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.630
We must kill her.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.430
Stop it!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.730
How many times have we repeated this now?

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.520
We have no choice, young prince.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:38.730
If we do not end the princess's life, this world will be destroyed.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.110
I will defeat the Masagami.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:46.870
Despite that a challenger to the Masagami appeared, there is no assurance that he will defeat them.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:52.410
If you remain resolute in stopping us, we will not show any mercy, even to you, young prince.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.370
Who are they?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:04.050
We merely delivered punishment to those who did not agree with us and plotted to allow the princess to escape.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.260
What a grave mistake you've made.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.140
You will kill Kuro, one way or another?

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.390
Correct.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:16.900
Reishin-sama!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.610
What is happening?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.940
We will lend you our strength!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.650
You...

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.790
Stop the young prince!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.170
No, that's...

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.750
Reishin-sama!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:31.800
If the Reiouseki absorbs the blood of the Shishigami's shrine maiden, the Earth Seal will be broken.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:37.060
Now, come and release our Shishigami clan from the curse of Masagami.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:44.270
Reishin, as long as it's you... You will definitely succeed.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.820
Mother...

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.840
With that, I departed the Sacred Precincts.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:08.090
The person that Mother saw challenging the Masagami...

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:13.720
I planned to form a contract with this person upon her ascension into a Master Root.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:20.730
Although it took much time, by manufacturing Master Roots, I was able to dramatically increase the amount of Tera,

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:26.400
which caused the wormhole entrance to open and form the path that led to all the Reiseki.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.900
Then, I destroyed every Reiseki in the world.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:52.720
And then, with a perfect understanding of each other,

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:59.640
we formed a contract with the one who will challenge Masagami, who had become a Master Root.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:11.360
So before the Masagami completely revives, we will undo the seal and defeat him.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.000
Yakumo!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.300
What does Reishin plan on doing after breaking the seal?

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.050
And why Kuro?

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.220
That is due to the Shishigami princess's...

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.010
No... I cannot be certain of that yet.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.890
We still don't know whether or not this girl will lead us to our destruction.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.140
Destruction?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.820
Pull yourself together, Riona.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:54.650
We've always been rescued by Kuro-chan. This time it's our turn...

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.740
Yakumo!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.830
Use my Tera!

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.910
Riona-san.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.540
I feel Riona-san's thick Tera flowing into me.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.000
The synchro is deepening.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.130
Go!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.970
Exceed, Land Spout!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.310
You did it!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.230
What?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:14.360
This sound is...

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.330
Kuro?

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:22.990
No!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.240
Now I've confirmed it with my own eyes.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.030
That emblem... It is the same as the one in the records after all.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.620
Kuro...

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.170
You've finally appeared.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.050
Keita-san...

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.880
She hasn't awakened yet?

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:28.640
If one awakens, the remaining two will surely do so as well.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:37.150
I am... the Masagami, right?

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:43.070
Kuro... was the one who placed the curse of the Doppeliner system on humans?

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.450
What is this feeling?

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.040
The God that is "Three as one..."

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.330
The Masagami.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:59.420
My brother... started everything... for my sake.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.470
To save me!

